{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50915","headline":"献冯李二相公（题拟） · 张义方","name":"献冯李二相公（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨处沙堤同日筑，其如啓沃藉良谋。\n民间有病谁开口，府下无人只点头。\n（见《江南余载》卷下，云「冯延巳、李建勳拜相，张义方献诗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张义方","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}